{"seq":3,"slug":"model-routing","title":"Model Routing","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-cost-latency-optimization/model-routing","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"model-tiering","title":"模型分级","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-cost-latency-optimization/model-routing/model-tiering","wordCount":2211,"readingTime":9},{"seq":2,"slug":"cascade-routing","title":"级联路由","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-cost-latency-optimization/model-routing/cascade-routing","wordCount":2480,"readingTime":10},{"seq":3,"slug":"fallback-degradation","title":"降级与容灾","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-cost-latency-optimization/model-routing/fallback-degradation","wordCount":2632,"readingTime":11}],"introHtml":"<p>不是所有任务都值得用最强的模型。本章讲如何按任务难度给模型分级：高频简单任务交给小模型、主体工作交给中档、只把最难的问题留给旗舰。在此基础上展开级联路由的实现形态与成本数学，以及当上游不可用时从重试、备用模型到优雅拒绝的完整降级阶梯，把成本与可用性放在同一套路由体系里管理。</p>\n"}